{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/76363cc07333bcd6f02328ba4314541f.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/76363cc07333bcd6f02328ba4314541f.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/76363cc07333bcd6f02328ba4314541f.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover an occult mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Alex Evans, your homecoming to Alderwood Island is anything but ordinary. A string of mysteries has set the entire island on edge. Your mother has vanished suddenly without a trace and a body was discovered in the woods. Together with old and new friends, investigate these incidents and unearth a conspiracy nobody saw coming\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/e3fd069a311d9af390402c67b05da6ac.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/e3fd069a311d9af390402c67b05da6ac.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/e3fd069a311d9af390402c67b05da6ac.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team up with old and new friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate Alderwood Island\u2019s secrets together! Meet new friends out on the trails, group up to explore Ride Islands for a change of pace, or compete together in group races. Explore the island and all it has to offer in galloping getaways and discover why this land has always been a special place for horses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/4bf0ee6a4abde4c9b0a688cb10082d1f.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/4bf0ee6a4abde4c9b0a688cb10082d1f.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/4bf0ee6a4abde4c9b0a688cb10082d1f.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take the reins and explore a breathtaking open world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is home to scenic vistas where beauty and wonder are found with every step! Discover beautiful nooks and crannies as you wander cozy woods, peaceful beaches, and rolling mountainside hills. What secrets will you and your steed uncover as you roam this splendid island? If you\u2019re looking for a change of pace, hop on the ferry to explore a scenic Ride Island with a group of friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/da81d7ee270ffb1684e6b4a458f6377c.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/da81d7ee270ffb1684e6b4a458f6377c.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/da81d7ee270ffb1684e6b4a458f6377c.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Foster an unbreakable bond with your horse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure that puts your bond to the test. Even when your world has fallen apart, your horse has your back. You can always count on them, but can they count on you? Train up your horse in challenging races, care for them after a long ride, and even give them treats you\u2019ve foraged.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/5299358454ddbd63b6bd3aa4f71c9e09.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/5299358454ddbd63b6bd3aa4f71c9e09.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/5299358454ddbd63b6bd3aa4f71c9e09.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete in races and train to become a champion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Group up with friends and compete in races that take you across the island. From challenging forest treks with tight turns, to scenic river crossings and intense jumping courses - with over 15 to choose from, there\u2019s something for everyone! Will you and your horse leave your mark on the leaderboards and become the reigning champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Express yourself and show off your style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the character of your dreams! Customize your horse and your character by choosing from a variety of clothing, tack, and equipment options. More new items are added with regular updates. Acquire new accessories by helping village factions and even upgrade gear to enhance your performance.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Reach your Barn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3258290/be55f14d2ca40a238dd21ee3e677faccf7e9f2f8.jpg"},{"name":"Chapter 1","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3258290/b0c0a72d3876b06616363df77929d3e14e53d270.jpg"}],"total":2},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3258290?t=1757078052","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/9aefa10121d21f3fd4e04b1bb0a493c94ff7f69f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1757078052","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/075940a59f85ab91ccbb7413330df3c5c72ec726/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757078052","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/075940a59f85ab91ccbb7413330df3c5c72ec726/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757078052","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The main characters of Equinox Home Coming, Alex Evans, Sarah, (amongst others), are experiencing difficult times due to a death in their local community. The protagonist, Alex Evans, is also trying to find out what has happened to her mother that has disappeared recently.\r\n\r\nDue to the death of the local teenager, and the disappearance of her mother, the protagonist and NPC will have to face violence, complex emotions, and difficult themes. As such, it may contain content not appropriate for all ages, and may not be appropriate for viewing at work, with cautions suggested for Violence, Blood, Self-Harm, Strong Language, and Use of Alcohol."},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/76363cc07333bcd6f02328ba4314541f.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/76363cc07333bcd6f02328ba4314541f.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/76363cc07333bcd6f02328ba4314541f.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Uncover an occult mystery</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As Alex Evans, your homecoming to Alderwood Island is anything but ordinary. A string of mysteries has set the entire island on edge. Your mother has vanished suddenly without a trace and a body was discovered in the woods. Together with old and new friends, investigate these incidents and unearth a conspiracy nobody saw coming\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/e3fd069a311d9af390402c67b05da6ac.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/e3fd069a311d9af390402c67b05da6ac.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/e3fd069a311d9af390402c67b05da6ac.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Team up with old and new friends</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate Alderwood Island\u2019s secrets together! Meet new friends out on the trails, group up to explore Ride Islands for a change of pace, or compete together in group races. Explore the island and all it has to offer in galloping getaways and discover why this land has always been a special place for horses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/4bf0ee6a4abde4c9b0a688cb10082d1f.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/4bf0ee6a4abde4c9b0a688cb10082d1f.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/4bf0ee6a4abde4c9b0a688cb10082d1f.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take the reins and explore a breathtaking open world</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The island is home to scenic vistas where beauty and wonder are found with every step! Discover beautiful nooks and crannies as you wander cozy woods, peaceful beaches, and rolling mountainside hills. What secrets will you and your steed uncover as you roam this splendid island? If you\u2019re looking for a change of pace, hop on the ferry to explore a scenic Ride Island with a group of friends!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/da81d7ee270ffb1684e6b4a458f6377c.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/da81d7ee270ffb1684e6b4a458f6377c.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/da81d7ee270ffb1684e6b4a458f6377c.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Foster an unbreakable bond with your horse</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on an adventure that puts your bond to the test. Even when your world has fallen apart, your horse has your back. You can always count on them, but can they count on you? Train up your horse in challenging races, care for them after a long ride, and even give them treats you\u2019ve foraged.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/5299358454ddbd63b6bd3aa4f71c9e09.poster.avif?t=1757078052\" width=616 height=228 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/5299358454ddbd63b6bd3aa4f71c9e09.webm?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/extras/5299358454ddbd63b6bd3aa4f71c9e09.mp4?t=1757078052\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Compete in races and train to become a champion</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Group up with friends and compete in races that take you across the island. From challenging forest treks with tight turns, to scenic river crossings and intense jumping courses - with over 15 to choose from, there\u2019s something for everyone! Will you and your horse leave your mark on the leaderboards and become the reigning champion?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Express yourself and show off your style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design the character of your dreams! Customize your horse and your character by choosing from a variety of clothing, tack, and equipment options. More new items are added with regular updates. Acquire new accessories by helping village factions and even upgrade gear to enhance your performance.</p>","developers":["Blue Scarab Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3258290/3ce312e5ca8c41f5ecfdbec9e7c7698bce75f74b/header.jpg?t=1757078052","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3258290/1385635886/46745f9f6f4e8a0f2c3260e8b9a5d6b8cf0ced72/1750825203/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746694826","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3258290/1385635886/46745f9f6f4e8a0f2c3260e8b9a5d6b8cf0ced72/1750825203/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746694826","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3258290/1385635886/46745f9f6f4e8a0f2c3260e8b9a5d6b8cf0ced72/1750825203/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1746694826","id":257136725,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136725/movie480.mp4?t=1746694826","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136725/movie_max.mp4?t=1746694826"},"name":"Launch Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257136725/0c35ca850bafe98ed7e8db7a462a3468da630820/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746694826","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136725/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746694826","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257136725/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746694826"}},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3258290/1768527956/f56aa2c5c715a2399c99a99dc0e1bd3b32293c01/1750825207/dash_av1.mpd?t=1746694829","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3258290/1768527956/f56aa2c5c715a2399c99a99dc0e1bd3b32293c01/1750825207/dash_h264.mpd?t=1746694829","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3258290/1768527956/f56aa2c5c715a2399c99a99dc0e1bd3b32293c01/1750825207/hls_26